&lt;h3&gt;About The Team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The AI Platforms team builds the shared foundation that lets Life360 use AI quickly and safely. Today, that means powering AI adoption and productivity across the company: model access, agent tooling, and the infrastructure our engineers rely on every day. We work side by side with the teams that are reshaping how Life360 builds with agents. We’ll carry these AI foundations as we look forward towards our future AI product strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the Job&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Director of AI Platforms, you will build and lead the team through a defining shift: from supporting how Life360 works with AI to powering how AI shows up for our members. You will be a critical leader in our continued evolution for our agentic product development lifecycle (PDLC), turning early momentum into shared platforms, paved roads, and measurable results. Looking forward, you’ll shape how the platform supports AI inference and AI-powered features within our product.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report to the Chief Information Security Officer with close partnership across our entire leadership team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The US-based salary range for this position is $216,500 to $318,500 USD. We take into consideration an individual&#39;s background, job-related knowledge, skills, and experience in determining final salary. Base pay may also vary based on geographic location, with US work locations falling into one of three geographic tiers.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
