&lt;h3&gt;About the Job&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our leaders make fast decisions for families around the world, and the EA team keeps their time, priorities, and communications pointed at what matters. As &lt;strong&gt;Manager, Executive Administration&lt;/strong&gt;, you’ll lead a team of five EAs, personally support 2-3 executives, and set the standards, tools, and ways of working for how executive support runs at Life360. You’ll report to the Chief People Officer.&lt;/p&gt;
