&lt;li&gt;Build an AI-native EA team by setting the standard for how the team uses AI: which tools, for what work, and where human judgment is required.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define how coverage works for PTO and peak periods, and how internal requests are triaged and assigned. Set decision rights so EAs act independently on routine calls and escalate by exception.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage hiring, onboarding, and performance for the team across multiple time zones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the playbook for offsites and events. Keep travel, agenda, budget, and vendor management consistent across the team, while personally planning&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;for your own executives. Travel: 10-20%, including in-person team and leadership gatherings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and drive company-wide processes/platforms, including travel booking platform Navan.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support your executives&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
