&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted thought partner: offer insight and feedback, help shape plans, synthesize stakeholder input, and connect work to broader organizational goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare your executives for meetings with materials, context, and agendas, and track follow-ups, nudging stakeholders as needed to keep things moving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trust-based relationships with internal and external stakeholders, and help shape the leadership rituals and ways of working that keep the executive team connected.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate international and domestic travel and manage expenses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle sensitive information with professionalism, discretion, and sound judgment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years as an Executive Assistant supporting a CEO and/or multiple C-suite executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of people management experience leading Executive Assistants or a similar team&lt;/li&gt;
