&lt;li&gt;Be Direct With Respect - We communicate directly, even when it’s hard.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Members Before Metrics - We focus on building an exceptional experience for families.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High Intensity, High Impact - We do whatever it takes to get the job done.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
